@startuml
title 跨引擎指标先保留原义，再形成可比口径

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "原始指标层\nSpark TaskMetrics\nFlink Operator Metrics\nYARN resource-seconds" as raw #E0F2FE
rectangle "指标契约\nname / unit / kind / scope\nwindow / aggregation / reset / version" as contract
rectangle "身份与时间对齐\njob / instance / attempt / operator\nevent time / observed time" as align #FEF3C7
rectangle "派生事实\n输入量、处理量、分配资源\n执行时间、等待时间、失败成本" as facts
rectangle "引擎内诊断\n倾斜、反压、spill、fetch wait" as inside #DCFCE7
rectangle "跨引擎比较\n单位成本、SLA、吞吐趋势" as cross #DCFCE7

raw --> contract : 原值不改名覆盖
contract --> align
align --> facts
facts --> inside
facts --> cross

note right of contract
  同名不一定同义；
  Counter、Gauge、Meter 不能混算
end note

note right of cross
  只比较业务上等价的分母，
  不强行制造统一利用率
end note
@enduml
